lpful. We&#039;ve booked Chris, as we like his style of photography the ,most. The packages start at 1,175, which is very reasonable, in comparison to other prices we were quoted. \n\nHere&#039;s a link to their site &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/wpajamaica.com\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/wpajamaica.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1836098,"PostDate":1393665331,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We've just booked sungold's associates, WPA Jamaica. They have been very helpful. We've booked Chris, as we like his style of photography the ,most. The packages start at 1,175, which is very reasonable, in comparison to other prices we were quoted. <br>\nHere's a link to their site <a href='http:\/\/wpajamaica.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/wpajamaica.com\/<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"prendest@tcd.ie","IpAddress":"89.100.218.185","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1382557289,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274502.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"stefadile","Id":274502,"Name":"stefadile","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.27.208.221","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75889,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7b9b41796b145028dc2df2d28c99148b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;For fun and fresh..check out&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/joelfinnigen.com\/blog\/category\/weddings\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/joelfinnigen.com\/blog\/category\/weddings\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1836369,"PostDate":1393829942,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>For fun and fresh..check out\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/joelfinnigen.com\/blog\/category\/weddings\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/joelfinnigen....egory\/weddings\/<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"t_secretone@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"72.27.208.221","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393806792,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"lambrusco","Id":276968,"Name":"lambrusco","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.103.244.195","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75889,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a297fb5f9d0b8a36b6c681fe11ab0e64","RawContent":"[quote name=\"onyxluxenoir\" post=\"1829424\" timestamp=\"1390937471\"]\n[font=&#039;trebuchet ms&#039;]My sexy hubby and I were married 10\/26\/13 @ Iberostar Grand Hotel Rose Hall and we used Misha Earle.  She is amazing, talented and has the best personality-EVER.[\/font]\n\n[font=&#039;trebuchet ms&#039;]You WILL not be disappointed.[\/font]\n\n[font=&#039;trebuchet ms&#039;]Ciao, [\/font]\n\n[font=&#039;trebuchet ms&#039;]Keisha [\/font][\/quote]So glad to see this!! We booked Misha Earle for our wedding in July! She is super responsive, funny (even through email!). So excited!","Attachments":[],"Id":1837592,"PostDate":1394505710,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>onyxluxenoir, on 28 January 2014 - 11:31 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p><span  style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms';\">My sexy hubby and I were married 10\/26\/13 @ Iberostar Grand Hotel Rose Hall and we used Misha Earle.  She is amazing, talented and has the best personality-EVER.<\/span><br><br><span  style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms';\">You WILL not be disappointed.<\/span><br><br><span  style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms';\">Ciao, <\/span><br><br><span  style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms';\">Keisha <\/span><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nSo glad to see this!! We booked Misha Earle for our wedding in July! She is super responsive, funny (even through email!). So excited!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jadichristofaro@gmail.com","IpAddress":"198.7.227.141","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1369830406,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270079.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"redsoxgrl","Id":270079,"Name":"redsoxgrl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.148.79.60","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75889,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"43d7c964ed9d7235655f576b5db8b90b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;you can check out Merrick&#039;s work on facebook too. I would still highly recommend him! lol Good luck!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1837594,"PostDate":1394506667,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>you can check out Merrick's work on facebook too. I would still highly recommend him! lol Good luck!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;484\/st\/20111020\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/6168\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283458999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.23.164.165","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75889,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"66e54a56dd571f061d1e5b2297813161","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I would HIGHLY recommend Misha Earle. We used her for our wedding and TTD shoot last May, and she was absolutely FABULOUS. Check her out !!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.mishaearlephotography.com&#039;&gt;www.mishaearlephotography.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1838387,"PostDate":1394941269,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I would HIGHLY recommend Misha Earle. We used her for our wedding and TTD shoot last May, and she was absolutely FABULOUS. Check her out !!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.mishaearlephotography.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>www.mishaearlephotography.com<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sfox4214@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"173.23.164.165","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1345502013,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259396.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sfox4214","Id":259396,"Name":"sfox4214","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.69.13.169","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75889,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"81fc0d321b3ee6e88a1f8016c30d08b0","RawContent":"[quote name=\"lambrusco\" post=\"1836369\" timestamp=\"1393829942\"]\nFor fun and fresh..check out [url=\"http:\/\/joelfinnigen.com\/blog\/category\/weddings\/\"]http:\/\/joelfinnigen.com\/blog\/category\/weddings\/[\/url][\/quote]\nHe looks like a great photographer and i havent come across him before, have u worked woth them, whats the prices like.","Attachments":[],"Id":1843004,"PostDate":1396845302,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>lambrusco, on 02 March 2014 - 10:59 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>For fun and fresh..check out\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/joelfinnigen.com\/blog\/category\/weddings\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/joelfinnigen....egory\/weddings\/<\/a><\/p><\/div><\/div><br>\nHe looks like a great photographer and i havent come across him before, have u worked woth them, whats the prices like. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"angelsj247@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"98.227.45.9","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1382282517,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274395.jpg?_r=1399660815","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"angelsj247","Id":274395,"Name":"angelsj247","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.221.90.250","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75889,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9d88b8cac87df6b9e38ee2e8cf48505e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;I have had a horrible experience with Sungold it has been almost a year and I am still waiting for me wedding photos. I recieved a few, asked for all raw pictures even if they were horrible and I still am MISSING ALL MY RECEPTION PHOTOS. I have no pictures from the speeches, first dance, father\/daughter, garter toss...nothing from my reception. They said the memory called malfunctioned...would they not have a back-up system?!? I still have not been compensated or even apologized too.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1843240,"PostDate":1396976565,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">I have had a horrible experience with Sungold it has been almost a year and I am still waiting for me wedding photos. I recieved a few, asked for all raw pictures even if they were horrible and I still am MISSING ALL MY RECEPTION PHOTOS. I have no pictures from the speeches, first dance, father\/daughter, garter toss...nothing from my reception. They said the memory called malfunctioned...would they not have a back-up system?!? I still have not been compensated or even apologized too.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisa_kamaldeo@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"209.221.90.250","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1348925700,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-260834.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lisa K","Id":260834,"Name":"Lisa K","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.163.49.139","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75889,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e0004de73da2f3633414dc28a6193d00","RawContent":"[quote name=\"angelsj247\" post=\"1843004\" timestamp=\"1396845302\"]\nHe looks like a great photographer and i havent come across him before, have u worked woth them, whats the prices like.[\/quote]\nThey did a friend of mine wedding...she is not a social media persons so I cannot send you a link to ther specific wedding...his packages are value for money in terms of coverage and the final package that includes a gorgeous book ...she did the first package which starts at $2495 ... the thing i liked the most is when you saw the pictures u relived the memories and then some.","Attachments":[],"Id":1843242,"PostDate":1396977432,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>angelsj247, on 06 April 2014 - 08:35 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>He looks like a great photographer and i havent come across him before, have u worked woth them, whats the prices like.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>They did a friend of mine wedding...she is not a social media persons so I cannot send you a link to ther specific wedding...his packages are value for money in terms of coverage and the final package that includes a gorgeous book ...she did the first package which starts at $2495 ... the thing i liked the most is when you saw the pictures u relived the memories and then some.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"t_secretone@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"72.27.208.221","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393806792,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"lambrusco","Id":276968,"Name":"lambrusco","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"166.147.104.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75889,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8bce1af105cfd3ff7c8c981d23a994ad","RawContent":"Wow thanks for the review on subgold, thats horrible! \n\nIm going to book visual embrace- my budget was 1500 and ges got a package i like with a book and pictures look good, a little nervous bc i havent heard much about them here.","Attachments":[],"Id":1843249,"PostDate":1396979350,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Wow thanks for the review on subgold, thats horrible! <br>\nIm going to book visual embrace- my budget was 1500 and ges got a package i like with a book and pictures look good, a little nervous bc i havent heard much about them here. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"angelsj247@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"98.227.45.9","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1382282517,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274395.jpg?_r=1399660815","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"angelsj247","Id":274395,"Name":"angelsj247","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":38,"TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
