{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.223.75.238","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75889,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"14dba78032ae265ae17350a3f161c97e","RawContent":"Go with a videographer or both if you can afford it. Elite Media Concepts do videography lighting and DJ services. They are awesome! Here&#039;s a link to our wedding highlights video. We still have the full length video coming in a month or so. I find the video is such a great option. I went with the resort photographer just to have a few stills but they pale in comparison to the video. \n\n&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/elitemediaconcepts.com\/brigitte-marcel-more-than-words-can-say\/\"&gt;http:\/\/elitemediaconcepts.com\/brigitte-marcel-more-than-words-can-say\/&lt;\/a&gt;\n\n\n\n\nBrigitte Gravelle\n\nSent from my iPad using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1874157,"PostDate":1412344316,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Go with a videographer or both if you can afford it. Elite Media Concepts do videography lighting and DJ services. They are awesome! Here's a link to our wedding highlights video. We still have the full length video coming in a month or so. I find the video is such a great option. I went with the resort photographer just to have a few stills but they pale in comparison to the video. <br><br><a href='http:\/\/elitemediaconcepts.com\/brigitte-marcel-more-than-words-can-say\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/elitemediacon...-words-can-say\/<\/a><br><br><br><br>\nBrigitte Gravelle<br>\nSent from my iPad using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"brigbest@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"216.223.75.238","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357876018,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264253.jpg?_r=1412263677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Brigitte","Id":264253,"Name":"Brigitte","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.117.144.96","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75889,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"00bc4beac86c2117aba5ec27407efaf8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Without a doubt, Christopher Lee with WPAJ, is the best and so fun to work with. Awesome prices and you will not be disappointed. We got married November 2, 2014 and it was the best money I have ever spent. The memories I have are priceless. Everyone is in love with our pictures. We even did 2 trash the dress sessions with Chris. One at Dunns River Falls and the other at Rick&#039;s Cafe where I jumped in my wedding dress while holding hands with my new husband. We definitely took the plunge. Don&#039;t skimp on something so memorable. Go all out and feel comfortable having Christopher Lee be your photographer. I promise you will not be disappointed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":32608,"Name":"IMG_0104.JPG","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-283596-0-51169500-1434593478.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-283596-0-51169500-1434593478_thumb.jpg","Width":960,"Height":641}],"Id":1898817,"PostDate":1434593846,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1898817]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-283596-0-31809900-1434593590.jpg\" title=\"IMG_0018.JPG -  179.02KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-283596-0-31809900-1434593590.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"IMG_0018.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1898817]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-283596-0-32918600-1434593652.jpg\" title=\"IMG_0033.JPG -  262.08KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-283596-0-32918600-1434593652.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"IMG_0033.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1898817]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-283596-0-54669400-1434593738.jpg\" title=\"IMG_0109.JPG -  170.31KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-283596-0-54669400-1434593738.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"IMG_0109.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1898817]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-283596-0-48749800-1434592563.jpg\" title=\"IMG_0112.jpg -  106.96KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-283596-0-48749800-1434592563.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"IMG_0112.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1898817]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-283596-0-95309800-1434592997.jpg\" title=\"IMG_0110.JPG -  165.21KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-283596-0-95309800-1434592997.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"IMG_0110.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\nWithout a doubt, Christopher Lee with WPAJ, is the best and so fun to work with. Awesome prices and you will not be disappointed. We got married November 2, 2014 and it was the best money I have ever spent. The memories I have are priceless. Everyone is in love with our pictures. We even did 2 trash the dress sessions with Chris. One at Dunns River Falls and the other at Rick's Cafe where I jumped in my wedding dress while holding hands with my new husband. We definitely took the plunge. Don't skimp on something so memorable. Go all out and feel comfortable having Christopher Lee be your photographer. I promise you will not be disappointed.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"angiealise27@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"70.117.144.96","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1434591522,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283596.jpg?_r=1434596185","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":270,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"angiealise27","Id":283596,"Name":"angiealise27","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.223.133.148","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75889,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1480989086,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ec4e10dec760efc087981a0f51f494ec","RawContent":"Arnaud and his team are amazing! We were on a cruise ship for our honeymoon but wanted some professional pictures done in Jamaica. When we got to Jamaica we were met by Phillip who did our pictures. He listened to what we wanted and made us feel comfortable. In addition, he went above and beyond by showing us parts of Jamaica! About 10 days later we received over pictures and they are stunning!\n\n\nHDC Photo","Attachments":[],"Id":1916835,"PostDate":1480988985,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Arnaud and his team are amazing! We were on a cruise ship for our honeymoon but wanted some professional pictures done in Jamaica. When we got to Jamaica we were met by Phillip who did our pictures. He listened to what we wanted and made us feel comfortable. In addition, he went above and beyond by showing us parts of Jamaica! About 10 days later we received over pictures and they are stunning!<br><br>\nHDC Photo\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"robin.jett0214@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.223.133.148","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1480988565,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-288124.jpg?_r=1482463160","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"RobynJ","Id":288124,"Name":"RobynJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.114.6.3","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75889,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0e5465153fd462673a3064bbad1de0cd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am booking Clayton with WPA Jamaica for my wedding at Iberostar. Have you seen his work?!! I am soooo excited!!! They are very affordable and so friendly. I just got their pricing, going with the Sand and Sun Collection. It has everything I need.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1917677,"PostDate":1494103016,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am booking Clayton with WPA Jamaica for my wedding at Iberostar. Have you seen his work?!! I am soooo excited!!! They are very affordable and so friendly. I just got their pricing, going with the Sand and Sun Collection. It has everything I need.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"followdreams90@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.114.6.3","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1494100904,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"believe77","Id":288834,"Name":"believe77","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.252.228.163","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75889,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1495725764,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"933c7869f8be0d9529d03c051663775d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi I used &lt;strong&gt;Nicole Brown Photography&lt;\/strong&gt; for our wedding at Riu Resorts . She was on time and professional . She took amazing beach photographs and we loved our video of our ceremony . She was friendly with our guests and she made us feel so at ease. We enjoyed doing our getting ready images with her and she also covered the groom and groomsmen. She helped us to&amp;nbsp; do creative poses and&amp;nbsp; she brought props as well for our bridal party . We also purchased a photo book from her as well as it was absolutely gorgeous. It was a wonderful experience. Her team was a joy to work with and her packages are so affordable. She is easy to reach and she communicated with us right up until we got everything. I really liked the fact she had an online gallery for a month for us to view and share images with our family and friends who couldn&#039;t be there. She also offers a Jamming in Jamaica Package where she can take you out to see Jamaican culture and engage and interact with the locals . We were able to go and take photographs with a Rasta Man and a Coconut vendor. She really knows how to make sure you have an amazing experience and an excellent time&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is her information&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nicole Brown Photography&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Website:www.nicolecbrownphotography.com&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Email:nibrownphotography@[member=\"gmail\"].com&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Phone:(876) 404.6294&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1917757,"PostDate":1495725450,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi I used <strong>Nicole Brown Photography<\/strong> for our wedding at Riu Resorts . She was on time and professional . She took amazing beach photographs and we loved our video of our ceremony . She was friendly with our guests and she made us feel so at ease. We enjoyed doing our getting ready images with her and she also covered the groom and groomsmen. She helped us to\u00a0 do creative poses and\u00a0 she brought props as well for our bridal party . We also purchased a photo book from her as well as it was absolutely gorgeous. It was a wonderful experience. Her team was a joy to work with and her packages are so affordable. She is easy to reach and she communicated with us right up until we got everything. I really liked the fact she had an online gallery for a month for us to view and share images with our family and friends who couldn't be there. She also offers a Jamming in Jamaica Package where she can take you out to see Jamaican culture and engage and interact with the locals . We were able to go and take photographs with a Rasta Man and a Coconut vendor. She really knows how to make sure you have an amazing experience and an excellent time<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>This is her information<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Nicole Brown Photography<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Website:www.nicolecbrownphotography.com<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Email:nibrownphotography@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Phone:(876) 404.6294<\/strong><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisaray9201@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.252.228.163","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1495720564,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"lisaray9201","Id":288926,"Name":"lisaray9201","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.143.196.61","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75889,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"00db87f02ab5a503e831ba76a7f1ca8a","RawContent":"[quote name=\"lisaray9201\" post=\"1917757\" timestamp=\"1495725450\"]\nHi I used [b]Nicole Brown Photography[\/b] for our wedding at Riu Resorts . She was on time and professional . She took amazing beach photographs and we loved our video of our ceremony . She was friendly with our guests and she made us feel so at ease. We enjoyed doing our getting ready images with her and she also covered the groom and groomsmen. She helped us to  do creative poses and  she brought props as well for our bridal party . We also purchased a photo book from her as well as it was absolutely gorgeous. It was a wonderful experience. Her team was a joy to work with and her packages are so affordable. She is easy to reach and she communicated with us right up until we got everything. I really liked the fact she had an online gallery for a month for us to view and share images with our family and friends who couldn&#039;t be there. She also offers a Jamming in Jamaica Package where she can take you out to see Jamaican culture and engage and interact with the locals . We were able to go and take photographs with a Rasta Man and a Coconut vendor. She really knows how to make sure you have an amazing experience and an excellent time\n\n[b]This is her information[\/b]\n[b]Nicole Brown Photography[\/b]\n\n[b]Website:www.nicolecbrownphotography.com[\/b]\n[b]Email:nibrownphotography@[member=\"gmail\"].com[\/b]\n[b]Phone:(876) 404.6294[\/b][\/quote]Thanks for sharing your experience lisaray. Which RIU did you stay at? Was she one of the preferred vendors or did you have to pay a vendor fee?\n\nSent from my SM-G950W using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1917777,"PostDate":1496267551,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>lisaray9201, on 25 May 2017 - 07:17 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Hi I used <strong>Nicole Brown Photography<\/strong> for our wedding at Riu Resorts . She was on time and professional . She took amazing beach photographs and we loved our video of our ceremony . She was friendly with our guests and she made us feel so at ease. We enjoyed doing our getting ready images with her and she also covered the groom and groomsmen. She helped us to  do creative poses and  she brought props as well for our bridal party . We also purchased a photo book from her as well as it was absolutely gorgeous. It was a wonderful experience. Her team was a joy to work with and her packages are so affordable. She is easy to reach and she communicated with us right up until we got everything. I really liked the fact she had an online gallery for a month for us to view and share images with our family and friends who couldn't be there. She also offers a Jamming in Jamaica Package where she can take you out to see Jamaican culture and engage and interact with the locals . We were able to go and take photographs with a Rasta Man and a Coconut vendor. She really knows how to make sure you have an amazing experience and an excellent time<br><br><strong>This is her information<\/strong><br><strong>Nicole Brown Photography<\/strong><br><br><strong>Website:www.nicolecbrownphotography.com<\/strong><br><strong>Email:nibrownphotography@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com<\/strong><br><strong>Phone:(876) 404.6294<\/strong><\/p><\/div><\/div>\nThanks for sharing your experience lisaray. Which RIU did you stay at? Was she one of the preferred vendors or did you have to pay a vendor fee?<br><br>\nSent from my SM-G950W using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"caramiatia@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.244.21.45","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1458405509,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286520.jpg?_r=1458405512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"caramia","Id":286520,"Name":"caramia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.252.228.163","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75889,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f2bb9251a32c54d3f70a69fd2558fc41","RawContent":"I stayed at Club Riu Resorts in Ocho Rios Jamaica. She was not  one of RIU preferred vendors.  However I found her through wedding wire .I just loved her style and her professionalism . She does pay a portion of the vendor fee depending on which package and services you choose . Just contact her and she will give you the details. She is amazing.","Attachments":[],"Id":1917781,"PostDate":1496355430,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I stayed at Club Riu Resorts in Ocho Rios Jamaica. She was not  one of RIU preferred vendors.  However I found her through wedding wire .I just loved her style and her professionalism . She does pay a portion of the vendor fee depending on which package and services you choose . Just contact her and she will give you the details. She is amazing.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisaray9201@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.252.228.163","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1495720564,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"lisaray9201","Id":288926,"Name":"lisaray9201","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.235.89.223","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75889,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ed7204e81b122af011fc4e93b574d06e","RawContent":"[quote name=\"lisaray9201\" post=\"1917781\" timestamp=\"1496355430\"]\nI stayed at Club Riu Resorts in Ocho Rios Jamaica. She was not  one of RIU preferred vendors.  However I found her through wedding wire .I just loved her style and her professionalism . She does pay a portion of the vendor fee depending on which package and services you choose . Just contact her and she will give you the details. She is amazing.[\/quote]Thanks!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1917782,"PostDate":1496368612,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>lisaray9201, on 01 June 2017 - 02:17 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I stayed at Club Riu Resorts in Ocho Rios Jamaica. She was not  one of RIU preferred vendors.  However I found her through wedding wire .I just loved her style and her professionalism . She does pay a portion of the vendor fee depending on which package and services you choose . Just contact her and she will give you the details. She is amazing.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nThanks!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"caramiatia@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.244.21.45","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1458405509,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286520.jpg?_r=1458405512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"caramia","Id":286520,"Name":"caramia","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":38,"TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":30,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":20,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
