{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.237.243.211","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75889,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d34e69ee3ff72b8b7a0b7bf25dc4a789","RawContent":"I am getting married this April in Jamaica and still haven&#039;t booked a photographer. Can anyone recommend a photographer?","Attachments":[],"Id":1823502,"PostDate":1389058732,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am getting married this April in Jamaica and still haven't booked a photographer. Can anyone recommend a photographer?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenhaster@rogers.com","IpAddress":"99.237.243.211","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389057084,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"BrideJenny","Id":275905,"Name":"BrideJenny","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"151.142.207.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75889,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8e6078686a58f2b96dee297c2d4352c3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;My wedding was 3 weeks ago . i used Dwayne Watkins and i can say that he was AMAZING!!!! i can&#039;t brag enough about his work. SUper friendly and professional. He also help make sure that my wedding ran smoothly! My opinion from my experience is make sure you have a great photographer, whoever you decide to go with. don&#039;t listen to people when they say don&#039;t waste your money. at the end of the day, all your guests, decor, experience will only be remembered and captured if you have a great photographer. That should be one thing that you spend money on! your day goes by so fast, like seriously way too fast.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are by no means MODELS, but our photos differ :-) you can see some of my wedding pics on his site. you can also see my instagram page, i&#039;ve posted some of those pics and you can see how many comments and likes it has received, from people i don&#039;t even know. I will do a review this week on everything, be sure to check it out and hopefully it can be helpful for you based on&amp;nbsp;what i experienced!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/dwaynewatkins.com\/blog\/muneera-norman-married\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/dwaynewatkins.com\/blog\/muneera-norman-married\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My instagram page is @muneera_o&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1826311,"PostDate":1389818103,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>My wedding was 3 weeks ago . i used Dwayne Watkins and i can say that he was AMAZING!!!! i can't brag enough about his work. SUper friendly and professional. He also help make sure that my wedding ran smoothly! My opinion from my experience is make sure you have a great photographer, whoever you decide to go with. don't listen to people when they say don't waste your money. at the end of the day, all your guests, decor, experience will only be remembered and captured if you have a great photographer. That should be one thing that you spend money on! your day goes by so fast, like seriously way too fast.<\/p>\n<p>We are by no means MODELS, but our photos differ :-) you can see some of my wedding pics on his site. you can also see my instagram page, i've posted some of those pics and you can see how many comments and likes it has received, from people i don't even know. I will do a review this week on everything, be sure to check it out and hopefully it can be helpful for you based on\u00a0what i experienced!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/dwaynewatkins.com\/blog\/muneera-norman-married\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/dwaynewatkins...norman-married\/<\/a><\/p><br \/><p>My instagram page is @muneera_o<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"muneera0302@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"23.113.120.30","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1357572272,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263996.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"muneera0302","Id":263996,"Name":"muneera0302","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75889,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"75d295147d12d7f3f28c7a7f16d23afa","RawContent":"[quote name=\"BrideJenny\" post=\"1823502\" timestamp=\"1389058732\"]\nI am getting married this April in Jamaica and still haven&#039;t booked a photographer. Can anyone recommend a photographer?[\/quote]\nWould highly recommend Merrick Cousley. He did our wedding 2 years ago and we loved him! He lives in Kingston but will travel anywhere on the island. He is a joy to work with! [url=\"http:\/\/www.merrickcousley.com\"]www.merrickcousley.com[\/url]","Attachments":[],"Id":1826997,"PostDate":1389980330,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>BrideJenny, on 06 January 2014 - 05:38 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I am getting married this April in Jamaica and still haven't booked a photographer. Can anyone recommend a photographer?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Would highly recommend Merrick Cousley. He did our wedding 2 years ago and we loved him! He lives in Kingston but will travel anywhere on the island. He is a joy to work with! <a href='http:\/\/www.merrickcousley.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>www.merrickcousley.com<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;484\/st\/20111020\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/6168\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283458999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.79.22.1","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75889,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"23e860b27f04fde4dd742b0f57e953fd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;trebuchet ms&#039;, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;My sexy hubby and I were married 10\/26\/13 @ Iberostar Grand Hotel Rose Hall and we used Misha Earle. &amp;nbsp;She is amazing, talented and has the best personality-EVER.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;trebuchet ms&#039;, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;You WILL not be disappointed.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;trebuchet ms&#039;, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Ciao,&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:&#039;trebuchet ms&#039;, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Keisha&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1829424,"PostDate":1390937471,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', helvetica, sans-serif;\">My sexy hubby and I were married 10\/26\/13 @ Iberostar Grand Hotel Rose Hall and we used Misha Earle. \u00a0She is amazing, talented and has the best personality-EVER.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', helvetica, sans-serif;\">You WILL not be disappointed.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', helvetica, sans-serif;\">Ciao,\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', helvetica, sans-serif;\">Keisha\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"atmosphere0000@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"50.79.22.1","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357676614,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"onyxluxenoir","Id":264080,"Name":"onyxluxenoir","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.56.145.42","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75889,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ee650d2a0f8e10874c222be8cd1bf2f3","RawContent":"I&#039;m getting married in July 2014 we are using Marica Roberts \n\n&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.jamaicanphotography.com&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.jamaicanphotography.com&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1830373,"PostDate":1391142444,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm getting married in July 2014 we are using Marica Roberts <br>\n<a href='http:\/\/www.jamaicanphotography.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.jamaicanphotography.com<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"itswrightsc@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.56.145.42","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1372744522,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271112.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"itswrightsc","Id":271112,"Name":"itswrightsc","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.250.61.119","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75889,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"45833a956cd2f9cb98a08c2ef31d4e0d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We are using Saab:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/saabwedding.com&#039;&gt;http:\/\/saabwedding.com&lt;\/a&gt;. Good luck in your search! &lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1833582,"PostDate":1392322790,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We are using Saab:\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/saabwedding.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/saabwedding.com<\/a>. Good luck in your search! <\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"thesugaredplum@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.121.138.113","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1390934058,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"mnemosyne","Id":276371,"Name":"mnemosyne","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.227.45.9","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75889,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"512e35b06bec122a9ac0894a9c9e0e47","RawContent":"[quote name=\"muneera0302\" post=\"1826311\" timestamp=\"1389818103\"]\nMy wedding was 3 weeks ago . i used Dwayne Watkins and i can say that he was AMAZING!!!! i can&#039;t brag enough about his work. SUper friendly and professional. He also help make sure that my wedding ran smoothly! My opinion from my experience is make sure you have a great photographer, whoever you decide to go with. don&#039;t listen to people when they say don&#039;t waste your money. at the end of the day, all your guests, decor, experience will only be remembered and captured if you have a great photographer. That should be one thing that you spend money on! your day goes by so fast, like seriously way too fast.\nWe are by no means MODELS, but our photos differ :-) you can see some of my wedding pics on his site. you can also see my instagram page, i&#039;ve posted some of those pics and you can see how many comments and likes it has received, from people i don&#039;t even know. I will do a review this week on everything, be sure to check it out and hopefully it can be helpful for you based on what i experienced!\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/dwaynewatkins.com\/blog\/muneera-norman-married\/\"]http:\/\/dwaynewatkins.com\/blog\/muneera-norman-married\/[\/url]\n\nMy instagram page is @muneera_o[\/quote]Awesome pictures. Can you tell me how much he charged you? Thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":1834042,"PostDate":1392598775,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>muneera0302, on 15 January 2014 - 12:35 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>\nMy wedding was 3 weeks ago . i used Dwayne Watkins and i can say that he was AMAZING!!!! i can't brag enough about his work. SUper friendly and professional. He also help make sure that my wedding ran smoothly! My opinion from my experience is make sure you have a great photographer, whoever you decide to go with. don't listen to people when they say don't waste your money. at the end of the day, all your guests, decor, experience will only be remembered and captured if you have a great photographer. That should be one thing that you spend money on! your day goes by so fast, like seriously way too fast.<br>\nWe are by no means MODELS, but our photos differ :-) you can see some of my wedding pics on his site. you can also see my instagram page, i've posted some of those pics and you can see how many comments and likes it has received, from people i don't even know. I will do a review this week on everything, be sure to check it out and hopefully it can be helpful for you based on what i experienced!<br><br><a href='http:\/\/dwaynewatkins.com\/blog\/muneera-norman-married\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/dwaynewatkins...norman-married\/<\/a><br><br>\nMy instagram page is @muneera_o<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nAwesome pictures. Can you tell me how much he charged you? Thanks! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"angelsj247@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"98.227.45.9","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1382282517,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274395.jpg?_r=1399660815","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"angelsj247","Id":274395,"Name":"angelsj247","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.181.5.152","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75889,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0c09f7f89f27e4faf29af9044c9b6ae3","RawContent":"Subscribing to this thread. Good information.","Attachments":[],"Id":1834060,"PostDate":1392606166,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Subscribing to this thread. Good information.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pinkiesup08@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.181.5.152","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1374614124,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RandL2015","Id":271841,"Name":"RandL2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.227.45.9","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75889,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b17c367d2e04c8a100e35b92e3a514d6","RawContent":"Has anyone used zuluspro? Any info, so far the best prices. I also like merrick cousley but higher in price and dwayne watkins but i havent gotten a price from him yet. My budget is 1500-2000","Attachments":[],"Id":1834301,"PostDate":1392689341,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Has anyone used zuluspro? Any info, so far the best prices. I also like merrick cousley but higher in price and dwayne watkins but i havent gotten a price from him yet. My budget is 1500-2000\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":