Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71971,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"19bffe2f2e12f5ed4d4aebf17a31a602","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi there,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; The resort I&#039;m getting married had an $800 vendor fee for bringing in outside photographers. I have found one photographer who will cover up to $500 of the vendor fee. I&#039;m wondering if anyone can recommend other photographers that include something similar in the cost of their packages.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; p.s. Stacy Clarke photography covers up to $500&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1708588,"PostDate":1358699580,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi there,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The resort I'm getting married had an $800 vendor fee for bringing in outside photographers. I have found one photographer who will cover up to $500 of the vendor fee. I'm wondering if anyone can recommend other photographers that include something similar in the cost of their packages.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> p.s. Stacy Clarke photography covers up to $500<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kerryanne.robinson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.114.67.94","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1356025262,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"MrsViolo","Id":263389,"Name":"MrsViolo","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71971,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"142355ef7d82aff59249c0b00b1fcf1c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey there,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Of all the photographers that I considered and contacted (8 total) none of them covered any part of the vendor fee.&amp;nbsp; It is not standard practice for them to do so, and I believe you found one of the few exception that do. if anything, most will&amp;nbsp;have a preferred list of vendors that you can use where the vendor fee will be waived.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Good luck with you search and happy planning&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1708596,"PostDate":1358700676,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey there,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Of all the photographers that I considered and contacted (8 total) none of them covered any part of the vendor fee.\u00a0 It is not standard practice for them to do so, and I believe you found one of the few exception that do. if anything, most will\u00a0have a preferred list of vendors that you can use where the vendor fee will be waived.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Good luck with you search and happy planning<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tapurnell@msn.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1326174151,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-249670.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ChocoTaco7568","Id":249670,"Name":"ChocoTaco7568","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71971,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6dcbf8bd492e589b506100043c93afa7","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]ChocoTaco7568[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hey there, \n \n Of all the photographers that I considered and contacted (8 total) none of them covered any part of the vendor fee.  It is not standard practice for them to do so, and I believe you found one of the few exception that do. if anything, most will have a preferred list of vendors that you can use where the vendor fee will be waived.  \n \n Good luck with you search and happy planning[\/quote] \n \n I figured as much but I thought maybe if I found one, I&#039;d be able to find others :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1708704,"PostDate":1358718375,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>ChocoTaco7568<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hey there,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Of all the photographers that I considered and contacted (8 total) none of them covered any part of the vendor fee.\u00a0 It is not standard practice for them to do so, and I believe you found one of the few exception that do. if anything, most will\u00a0have a preferred list of vendors that you can use where the vendor fee will be waived.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Good luck with you search and happy planning<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I figured as much but I thought maybe if I found one, I'd be able to find others <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kerryanne.robinson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.114.67.94","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1356025262,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"MrsViolo","Id":263389,"Name":"MrsViolo","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71971,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5c0ae5e0ab84564cff79867a08060edb","RawContent":"Same as choco most photographers I contacted did t cover the vendor fee. Most resorts do have preferred vendors where the fee is waived but if you don&#039;t like any of the vendors on their list you can also look at the cost of booking your photographer into a room as most resorts also waive the fee if the vendor is staying on site for the minimum night requirement. A $800 fee is quite high so depending on what the room rates are it might be cheaper to book a room for 3 nights","Attachments":[],"Id":1708737,"PostDate":1358724394,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Same as choco most photographers I contacted did t cover the vendor fee. Most resorts do have preferred vendors where the fee is waived but if you don't like any of the vendors on their list you can also look at the cost of booking your photographer into a room as most resorts also waive the fee if the vendor is staying on site for the minimum night requirement. A $800 fee is quite high so depending on what the room rates are it might be cheaper to book a room for 3 nights\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dazeydawl14@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"70.76.192.165","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1327976330,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250750.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Dazeydawl","Id":250750,"Name":"Dazeydawl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71971,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":5,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5fef570d55cd7b96ed3b0229a2424aa8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;ve done a lot of research! It looks like a lot of photographers will pay for SOME of the vendor&#039;s fee. Or will book a room at the resort depending on where and the package you get which may also help avoid the vendors fees. Here&#039;s the info I&#039;ve gathered so far for anyone interested. I&#039;m also thinking a lot of things are negotiable!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"&gt; &lt;tbody&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:112px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Vendor&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:117px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Price 1&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:117px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Price 2&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:117px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Price 3&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:100px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;TTD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:98px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Vendor Fee&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:112px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Stacy Clarke Photography&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:117px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;$1395us &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;UP TO &lt;strong&gt;3 HOURS&lt;\/strong&gt; ON LOCATION &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;PHOTOGRAPHY, ALL USABLE IMAGES HIGH RESOLUTION EDITED ON A COPY RIGHT FREE CD, PHOTO SLIDE SHOW, ONLINE PROOFING &amp;amp; DELIVERY VIA DHL WITH TRACKING &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:117px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;$1595us &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;UP TO &lt;strong&gt;5 HOURS&lt;\/strong&gt; ON LOCATION &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;PHOTOGRAPHY, ALL USABLE IMAGES HIGH RESOLUTION EDITED ON A COPY RIGHT FREE CD, PHOTO SLIDE SHOW, ONLINE PROOFING &amp;amp; DELIVERY VIA DHL WITH TRACKING &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:117px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;$2095us &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;8 HOURS&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt; ON LOCATION &lt;strong&gt;(CAN BE SPLIT OVER 2 DAYS)&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;PHOTOGRAPHY, ALL USABLE IMAGES HIGH RESOLUTION EDITED ON A COPY RIGHT FREE CD, PHOTO SLIDE SHOW, ONLINE VIEWING &amp;amp; DELIVERY VIA DHL WITH TRACKING &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:100px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;No separate TTD shoot due to travel time. Will stay over night if we pick a package and do the TTD the following day&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:98px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;VENDOR FEE\u00e2\u20ac\u2122S UP TO THE AMOUNT OF $500US. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:112px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Saab Wedding&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:117px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;Associate Photographers Price - US 2400 &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;5 continuous hours coverage Two&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;photographers &lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;1 high resolution disc with about 350 images for printing &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;Photos online for viewing and sharing with family and friends &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:117px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;Associate Photographer Price - US $1500 &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;3 continuous hours coverage One photographer &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;1 high resolution disc with about 200 images for printing &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;Photos online for viewing and sharing with family and friends &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:117px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:100px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;Michael or Olive are US $500 per hour (US $350 for our associates This includes a high resolution disc of images for printing. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:98px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;None \u00e2\u20ac\u201c bride covers whole cost&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:112px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;ZULUSPRO&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:117px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;$A1600&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Full coverage&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Editing&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;2 month online gallery&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;DVD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:117px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;2900&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Full Coverage&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;2 Photographers&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Editing&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;5 month online&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;one hour engagement session&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Slide show&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:117px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:100px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;No charge \u00e2\u20ac\u201c but requires stay at resort overnight &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:98px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Will be staying at resort over night??&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:112px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Merrick Cousley&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:117px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;$2300 &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;Coverage \u00e2\u20ac\u201c preparation to reception &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;DVD with all images \u00e2\u20ac\u201c 300 images Photo retouch \u00e2\u20ac\u201c color balance, black &amp;amp; white, sepia toning, artistic, etc. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;Family online gallery \u00e2\u20ac\u201c one month of sharing with friends and family. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;Travel fees \u00e2\u20ac\u201c travel and accommodation included (Jamaica only) &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:117px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:117px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:100px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;$450&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;Trash the dress session (1 hour): 100-150 high-resolution images on CD. Exciting trend capturing romantic images wearing your wedding gown and suit at a location you wouldn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t dare to venture on your wedding day. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:98px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Travel fees included?&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Not vendor fees&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:112px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Alain &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Hottat&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:117px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;- For 1000 US$ - bride and groom getting ready, ceremony and after ceremony portraits at your wedding destination.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;including a minimum of 250 high resolution photographs fully edited ready for printery. Delivery on cd or dvd + an online gallery for friends and family.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:117px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;For 1400 US$, your entire wedding : preparation, ceremony, after ceremony portraits of couple, family &amp;amp; friends,&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;reception. This includes a minimum of 400 photos fully edited&amp;nbsp; on cd and ready for printery, a musical slide show and an online gallery.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:117px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;For 2000 US$, your entire wedding : preparation, ceremony, after ceremony portraits of couple, family &amp;amp; friends,&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;reception. This includes a minimum of 400 photos fully edited&amp;nbsp; on cd and ready for printery, a musical slide show and an online gallery,&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;and a&amp;nbsp;pro HD video of the best moments of your wedding, with your choice of music, edited to a minimum of 15-20 minutes on dvd.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:100px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Usually done the day after your wedding. 2-3 hours shooting at one or two locations. At least 120 printable images provided on cd.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;$800 trash the dress alone \/ $500 with wedding&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:98px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Takes half the vendor fee off the price of package&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:112px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Sandy May&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:117px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;3 hours of time&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;1100&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;private website on Pictage.com for viewing, sharing, and print ordering and a copyright free disk of all your final images, which usually contains between 600 and 900 images.&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:117px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;5 hours of time&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;1400&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Overtime \u00e2\u20ac\u201c 200 per hour&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;private website on Pictage.com for viewing, sharing, and print ordering and a copyright free disk of all your final images, which usually contains between 600 and 900 images.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:117px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:100px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:98px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Bride and groom pays vendor fee plus $200 travel fee&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:112px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Misha Earle&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:117px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;3 hours of location time&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;DVD photo show set to music of your choice&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Copyright free CD containing high-resolution files of all usable images&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Total 1500.00 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:117px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;5 hours of location time &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;DVD photo show set to music of your choice&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Copyright free CD containing high-resolution files of all usable images&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Total 2000.00 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:117px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;10 hours of location time (can be split to your specifications for a day before or next day shoot if desired)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;DVD photo show set to the music of your choice&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Photo Station for one hr (see below for details)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Copyright free CD containing high-resolution files of all usable images&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Total 3000.00 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:100px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Included in package&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:98px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;500 towards vendors fee&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;includes travel fees!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:112px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Brian Nejedly&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:117px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;3 hours&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Photos&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;$1500&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Video&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;$900&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:117px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;5 hours&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Photos&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;2000&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Video&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;$1500&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:117px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;8 hours&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Photos&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;$22800&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Video&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;$2000&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:100px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Free 2 hour trash the dress with 8 hour package&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:98px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Will pay $400 of the vendor fee&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:112px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;dianna cambell&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:117px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;All the images on a cd&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;A DVD slide with some of the images and music in the background&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;2-3hrs shooting time&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Pay for a room for two&amp;nbsp;$350us&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Total $1500us&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:117px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;All the images on cd&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;A DVD slide with some of the images and music in the background&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;A DVD (video)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;A next day shoot or trash the dress shoot&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Pay for a room for two&amp;nbsp;$350us&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Total $2000us&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;No time limit to this package&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:117px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:100px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Included in package&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:98px;\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\"&gt;Stays in resort \u00e2\u20ac\u201c avoid vendor fee?&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/tbody&gt; &lt;\/table&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1710178,"PostDate":1358963208,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I've done a lot of research! It looks like a lot of photographers will pay for SOME of the vendor's fee. Or will book a room at the resort depending on where and the package you get which may also help avoid the vendors fees. Here's the info I've gathered so far for anyone interested. I'm also thinking a lot of things are negotiable!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"> <tbody> <tr> <td style=\"width:112px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Vendor<\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:117px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Price 1<\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:117px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Price 2<\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:117px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Price 3<\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:100px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">TTD<\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:98px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Vendor Fee<\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/td> <\/tr> <tr> <td style=\"width:112px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Stacy Clarke Photography<\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:117px;\"> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">$1395us <\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">UP TO <strong>3 HOURS<\/strong> ON LOCATION <\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">PHOTOGRAPHY, ALL USABLE IMAGES HIGH RESOLUTION EDITED ON A COPY RIGHT FREE CD, PHOTO SLIDE SHOW, ONLINE PROOFING & DELIVERY VIA DHL WITH TRACKING <\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:117px;\"> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">$1595us <\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">UP TO <strong>5 HOURS<\/strong> ON LOCATION <\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">PHOTOGRAPHY, ALL USABLE IMAGES HIGH RESOLUTION EDITED ON A COPY RIGHT FREE CD, PHOTO SLIDE SHOW, ONLINE PROOFING & DELIVERY VIA DHL WITH TRACKING <\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:117px;\"> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">$2095us <\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">8 HOURS<\/span><\/strong><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"> ON LOCATION <strong>(CAN BE SPLIT OVER 2 DAYS)<\/strong> <\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">PHOTOGRAPHY, ALL USABLE IMAGES HIGH RESOLUTION EDITED ON A COPY RIGHT FREE CD, PHOTO SLIDE SHOW, ONLINE VIEWING & DELIVERY VIA DHL WITH TRACKING <\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:100px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">No separate TTD shoot due to travel time. Will stay over night if we pick a package and do the TTD the following day<\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:98px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">VENDOR FEE\u00e2\u20ac\u2122S UP TO THE AMOUNT OF $500US. <\/span><\/p> <\/td> <\/tr> <tr> <td style=\"width:112px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Saab Wedding<\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:117px;\"> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">Associate Photographers Price - US 2400 <\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">5 continuous hours coverage Two<\/span><\/strong><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"> <strong>photographers <\/strong><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">1 high resolution disc with about 350 images for printing <\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">Photos online for viewing and sharing with family and friends <\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:117px;\"> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">Associate Photographer Price - US $1500 <\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">3 continuous hours coverage One photographer <\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">1 high resolution disc with about 200 images for printing <\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">Photos online for viewing and sharing with family and friends <\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:117px;\"> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:100px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">Michael or Olive are US $500 per hour (US $350 for our associates This includes a high resolution disc of images for printing. <\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:98px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">None \u00e2\u20ac\u201c bride covers whole cost<\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/td> <\/tr> <tr> <td style=\"width:112px;\"> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">ZULUSPRO<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:117px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">$A1600<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Full coverage<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Editing<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">2 month online gallery<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">DVD<\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:117px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">2900<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Full Coverage<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">2 Photographers<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Editing<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">5 month online<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">one hour engagement session<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Slide show<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:117px;\"> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:100px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">No charge \u00e2\u20ac\u201c but requires stay at resort overnight <\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:98px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Will be staying at resort over night??<\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/td> <\/tr> <tr> <td style=\"width:112px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Merrick Cousley<\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:117px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">$2300 <\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">Coverage \u00e2\u20ac\u201c preparation to reception <\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">DVD with all images \u00e2\u20ac\u201c 300 images Photo retouch \u00e2\u20ac\u201c color balance, black & white, sepia toning, artistic, etc. <\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">Family online gallery \u00e2\u20ac\u201c one month of sharing with friends and family. <\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">Travel fees \u00e2\u20ac\u201c travel and accommodation included (Jamaica only) <\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:117px;\"> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:117px;\"> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:100px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">$450<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">Trash the dress session (1 hour): 100-150 high-resolution images on CD. Exciting trend capturing romantic images wearing your wedding gown and suit at a location you wouldn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t dare to venture on your wedding day. <\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:98px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Travel fees included?<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Not vendor fees<\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/td> <\/tr> <tr> <td style=\"width:112px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Alain <\/span><\/span><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Hottat<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:117px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">- For 1000 US$ - bride and groom getting ready, ceremony and after ceremony portraits at your wedding destination.<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">including a minimum of 250 high resolution photographs fully edited ready for printery. Delivery on cd or dvd + an online gallery for friends and family.<\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:117px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">For 1400 US$, your entire wedding : preparation, ceremony, after ceremony portraits of couple, family & friends,<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">reception. This includes a minimum of 400 photos fully edited\u00a0 on cd and ready for printery, a musical slide show and an online gallery.<\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:117px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">For 2000 US$, your entire wedding : preparation, ceremony, after ceremony portraits of couple, family & friends,<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">reception. This includes a minimum of 400 photos fully edited\u00a0 on cd and ready for printery, a musical slide show and an online gallery,<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">and a\u00a0pro HD video of the best moments of your wedding, with your choice of music, edited to a minimum of 15-20 minutes on dvd.<\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:100px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Usually done the day after your wedding. 2-3 hours shooting at one or two locations. At least 120 printable images provided on cd.\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">$800 trash the dress alone \/ $500 with wedding<\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:98px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Takes half the vendor fee off the price of package<\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/td> <\/tr> <tr> <td style=\"width:112px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Sandy May<\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:117px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">3 hours of time<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">1100<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">private website on Pictage.com for viewing, sharing, and print ordering and a copyright free disk of all your final images, which usually contains between 600 and 900 images.\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:117px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">5 hours of time<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">1400<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Overtime \u00e2\u20ac\u201c 200 per hour<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">private website on Pictage.com for viewing, sharing, and print ordering and a copyright free disk of all your final images, which usually contains between 600 and 900 images.<\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:117px;\"> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:100px;\"> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:98px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Bride and groom pays vendor fee plus $200 travel fee<\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/td> <\/tr> <tr> <td style=\"width:112px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Misha Earle<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:117px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">3 hours of location time<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">DVD photo show set to music of your choice<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Copyright free CD containing high-resolution files of all usable images<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <em><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Total 1500.00 USD<\/span><\/span><\/em><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/td> <td