jedly<\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:117px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">3 hours<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Photos<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">$1500<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Video<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">$900<\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:117px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">5 hours<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Photos<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">2000<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Video<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">$1500<\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:117px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">8 hours<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Photos<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">$22800<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Video<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">$2000<\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:100px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Free 2 hour trash the dress with 8 hour package<\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:98px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Will pay $400 of the vendor fee<\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/td> <\/tr> <tr> <td style=\"width:112px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">dianna cambell<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:117px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">All the images on a cd<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">A DVD slide with some of the images and music in the background<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">2-3hrs shooting time<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Pay for a room for two\u00a0$350us<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Total $1500us<\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:117px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">All the images on cd<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">A DVD slide with some of the images and music in the background<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">A DVD (video)<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">A next day shoot or trash the dress shoot<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Pay for a room for two\u00a0$350us<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Total $2000us<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">No time limit to this package<\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:117px;\"> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:100px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Included in package<\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/td> <td style=\"width:98px;\"> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Stays in resort \u00e2\u20ac\u201c avoid vendor fee?<\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/tbody> <\/table>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kerryanne.robinson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.114.67.94","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1356025262,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"MrsViolo","Id":263389,"Name":"MrsViolo","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71971,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a07b8053194352ff7e82579ac2b904a8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thank you so much for posting this!&amp;nbsp; We are thinking about using Misha Earle.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;ve connected to her work the most and it is so helpful to see her price list.&amp;nbsp; I havent been too impressed about Digipix ltd- that is Iberostar Grand Rose Hall&#039;s photographer of choice.&amp;nbsp; Choices Choices Choices!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Ciao&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1710480,"PostDate":1359000014,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thank you so much for posting this!\u00a0 We are thinking about using Misha Earle.\u00a0 I've connected to her work the most and it is so helpful to see her price list.\u00a0 I havent been too impressed about Digipix ltd- that is Iberostar Grand Rose Hall's photographer of choice.\u00a0 Choices Choices Choices!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Ciao<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"atmosphere0000@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"50.79.22.1","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357676614,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"onyxluxenoir","Id":264080,"Name":"onyxluxenoir","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71971,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"09eb30e9037bde7b584987e93d449897","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thank you so much for positing this! It&#039;s so helpful :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1710724,"PostDate":1359052130,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thank you so much for positing this! It's so helpful <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"powerinsisterhood@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1339444112,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-256524.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":167,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DanielleJasmine","Id":256524,"Name":"DanielleJasmine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71971,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d34eaafdf2319a73977df926c43639a8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Does anybody know what the vendor fees are for the Iberostar Rose Hall Beach???&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1711273,"PostDate":1359138915,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Does anybody know what the vendor fees are for the Iberostar Rose Hall Beach???<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"perreault.ashley@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1352862962,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262353.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AshleyP","Id":262353,"Name":"AshleyP","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71971,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"00a3642cb852d46b4e34fe3f390b9384","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Ladies,&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I am having a hard time deciding -- I need to know from past brides that had a videographer if anyone felt that they were too intrusive? I have been stressing a little over this and really need your help. I want to have the video for the fact that so many can&#039;t make the wedding (especially his family) but at the same time I dont&#039; want them to be noticed or feel that they take away from the romance\/ ambiance of the ceremony etc... Thoughts please?? Also has anyone ever used Marcia Roberts videographer? I am pretty darn excited that we just booked with her...such a fabulous lady!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1718735,"PostDate":1360504838,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Ladies,\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am having a hard time deciding -- I need to know from past brides that had a videographer if anyone felt that they were too intrusive? I have been stressing a little over this and really need your help. I want to have the video for the fact that so many can't make the wedding (especially his family) but at the same time I dont' want them to be noticed or feel that they take away from the romance\/ ambiance of the ceremony etc... Thoughts please?? Also has anyone ever used Marcia Roberts videographer? I am pretty darn excited that we just booked with her...such a fabulous lady!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kerrydoyle_20@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1352253054,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262150.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KDoyle","Id":262150,"Name":"KDoyle","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71971,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a0df552567efba8f1fcaad37f5735e63","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Kdoyle,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I am planning my 2nd (and final :)) wedding right now.&amp;nbsp; My first wedding was a local (Kentucky) wedding and I had a videographer and a photographer.&amp;nbsp; My ex and I watched our wedding video a million times and truly treasured it.&amp;nbsp; Our videographer wasn&#039;t intrusive at all and really captured the emotions of the day.&amp;nbsp; I can&#039;t promise all videographers will deliver a great product and not be intrusive but I know I really valued my video and found it as a way to reconnect to that day.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1726807,"PostDate":1362035831,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Kdoyle,<\/p> <p> I am planning my 2nd (and final <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>) wedding right now.\u00a0 My first wedding was a local (Kentucky) wedding and I had a videographer and a photographer.\u00a0 My ex and I watched our wedding video a million times and truly treasured it.\u00a0 Our videographer wasn't intrusive at all and really captured the emotions of the day.\u00a0 I can't promise all videographers will deliver a great product and not be intrusive but I know I really valued my video and found it as a way to reconnect to that day.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mikesbride@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1356719355,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263573.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mikesbride","Id":263573,"Name":"Mikesbride","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":30,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
