{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"65.94.177.160","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81015,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"21689f938ab72ed812f0347376929b91","RawContent":"Hello! \n\nMy name is Ariane and my fianc\u00e9 and I are currently planning our May 2018 wedding at the Royalton White Sands (RWS) resort in Jamaica. \n\nWe actually got engaged at the Bahia Principe resort in Runaway Bay back in 2012 when we were still university students, so Jamaica as our destination location has special significance to us. We are so excited!! We&#039;ve reserved 50 spots at the RWS and have just sent out our wedding invites this week. Woohoo!! \n\nI just found this website and can&#039;t wait to see what\/how other brides are planning their destination wedding! \n\nAny other brides tying the knot in Jamaica too? \n\nLet share tips\/tricks\/ideas!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1917565,"PostDate":1492226051,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello! <br>\nMy name is Ariane and my fianc\u00e9 and I are currently planning our May 2018 wedding at the Royalton White Sands (RWS) resort in Jamaica. <br>\nWe actually got engaged at the Bahia Principe resort in Runaway Bay back in 2012 when we were still university students, so Jamaica as our destination location has special significance to us. We are so excited!! We've reserved 50 spots at the RWS and have just sent out our wedding invites this week. Woohoo!! <br>\nI just found this website and can't wait to see what\/how other brides are planning their destination wedding! <br>\nAny other brides tying the knot in Jamaica too? <br>\nLet share tips\/tricks\/ideas!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ariane022@hotmail.ca","IpAddress":"65.94.177.160","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1492224622,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"ariane022","Id":288747,"Name":"ariane022","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.95.180.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81015,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5e5f7d3da3eaf86c61a9e185493268f4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congratulations Ariane!! Royalton White Sands is an awesome resort and Jamaica is a great location.&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1917591,"PostDate":1492669556,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congratulations Ariane!! Royalton White Sands is an awesome resort and Jamaica is a great location.\u00a0 <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>? We are an award winning travel agency and you can read our reviews <\/span><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>HERE.<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>Awards and recognition: <\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Palace Resorts Top PRO Agency <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency | <\/span><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner | Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"patty@wrighttravelagency.com","IpAddress":"76.95.92.213","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1278657480,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230028.jpg?_r=1398727965","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TA Patty","Id":230028,"Name":"TA Patty","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.126.147.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81015,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"289973cf812925e9b0773243f0c14aa7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey Ariane! How exciting!!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m also getting married @ The Royalton White Sands in Montego Bay in May 2018 :) :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am only in the beginning stages of planning... still TONS to do! I havent really decided on all the details yet, just chose the location of our ceremony. Our budget is pretty tight so we need to read through all of the options and see what works best financially.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Maybe we can give each other advice\/tips\/ideas along the way... I am trying to think of ways to cut costs, so may not be using floral arrangements as center pieces, instead might be coming up with a cheaper option as long as it is lightweight and will travel well packed in our suitcases haha.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy Planning!!! &amp;amp; Congrats!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1917597,"PostDate":1492919899,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey Ariane! How exciting!!!!<\/p>\n<p>I'm also getting married @ The Royalton White Sands in Montego Bay in May 2018 <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>I am only in the beginning stages of planning... still TONS to do! I havent really decided on all the details yet, just chose the location of our ceremony. Our budget is pretty tight so we need to read through all of the options and see what works best financially.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Maybe we can give each other advice\/tips\/ideas along the way... I am trying to think of ways to cut costs, so may not be using floral arrangements as center pieces, instead might be coming up with a cheaper option as long as it is lightweight and will travel well packed in our suitcases haha.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning!!! & Congrats!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"saraintili@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"69.126.147.59","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1492918845,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"sintili","Id":288778,"Name":"sintili","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.31.40.247","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81015,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d721ee24da876151c3adcc7d791bc0e4","RawContent":"Hi! I&#039;m Emily and my fianc\u00e9, Robert, and I are getting married March 24, 2018 at Hyatt Ziva Montego Bay! Early stages of planning...feeling a little overwhelmed, lost, but so excited!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1917742,"PostDate":1495606579,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi! I'm Emily and my fianc\u00e9, Robert, and I are getting married March 24, 2018 at Hyatt Ziva Montego Bay! Early stages of planning...feeling a little overwhelmed, lost, but so excited!! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"edailymle@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"76.31.40.247","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1495606193,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Emily0482","Id":288918,"Name":"Emily0482","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"73.129.153.134","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81015,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"39eed88698e8ee67e801563656a4a34b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi ladies!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am in the beginning stages of planning our July 2018 Jamaica wedding. So far, I&#039;ve gotten prices\/packages for Iberostar and Royalton White Sands in Montego Bay. I like Iberostar a lot better because it seems to offer more in its all-inclusive. I am looking for lots of activities, entertainment, and non-motorized water sports. lol &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m considering Ocho Rios, too. I really want an awesome beach and some of the reviews for Montego Bay mention rocky beaches :(. Also, it must be kid friendly for our little one and Riu Ocho Rios has a kids club\/camp. What other resorts have you all looked into?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1917752,"PostDate":1495677577,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi ladies!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am in the beginning stages of planning our July 2018 Jamaica wedding. So far, I've gotten prices\/packages for Iberostar and Royalton White Sands in Montego Bay. I like Iberostar a lot better because it seems to offer more in its all-inclusive. I am looking for lots of activities, entertainment, and non-motorized water sports. lol \u00a0I'm considering Ocho Rios, too. I really want an awesome beach and some of the reviews for Montego Bay mention rocky beaches <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/>. Also, it must be kid friendly for our little one and Riu Ocho Rios has a kids club\/camp. What other resorts have you all looked into?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"soon2bslater@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"73.129.153.134","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1491010082,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SlatersWife","Id":288703,"Name":"SlatersWife","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":5,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
