{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.174.21.53","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81110,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9ba09582c0e21c2505afe83f57678a63","RawContent":"We have finally decided on mexico, trying to decide either cancun or riviera maya and then cant decide on a hotel! Lol any suggestions, must be family friendly, have a great pool and beach and mexican food!!!! Dont want people breaking the bank but still want a great experience (all inclusive)\n\n\nSent from my SM-G935T using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1918050,"PostDate":1502491067,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We have finally decided on mexico, trying to decide either cancun or riviera maya and then cant decide on a hotel! Lol any suggestions, must be family friendly, have a great pool and beach and mexican food!!!! Dont want people breaking the bank but still want a great experience (all inclusive)<br><br>\nSent from my SM-G935T using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ms.wedding.720@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.58.233.104","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1502383678,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"scamacho","Id":289233,"Name":"scamacho","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.250.29.210","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81110,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ba1e07c7583d9fa4f070f142b81c71cc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;azul sensatori and also generations maya both family friendly all part of karisma hotels amazing food&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1918055,"PostDate":1502803851,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>azul sensatori and also generations maya both family friendly all part of karisma hotels amazing food\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Francesca\u00a0","Email":"fandreolli@aol.com","IpAddress":"207.250.29.210","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1502114633,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-289213.jpg?_r=1502194320","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"fandreolli","Id":289213,"Name":"fandreolli","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.250.140.90","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81110,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"18e19f634719b693f878cb465f8391ca","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"scamacho\"] - &amp;nbsp;I second&amp;nbsp;@[member=\"fandreolli\"] - Azul Sensatori is a great option!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I would recommend finding a travel agent &amp;nbsp;- give them your list of &#039;must-haves&#039; and &#039;wish-lists&#039; for a venue, and they should come back to you with a few options. I gave our TA a long list, and she came back with 4 options in Riviera Maya and 4 in Punta Cana. We selected Azul Sensatori because it was Family Friendly, with adults only, less expensive, and great resort, good food, and overall a good vibe. Plus, she negotiated 2017 room rates for our 2018 wedding - saving our guests $$.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1918056,"PostDate":1502817717,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"289233\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/289233-scamacho\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">scamacho<\/span><\/a> - \u00a0I second\u00a0@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"289213\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/289213-fandreolli\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">fandreolli<\/span><\/a> - Azul Sensatori is a great option!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I would recommend finding a travel agent \u00a0- give them your list of 'must-haves' and 'wish-lists' for a venue, and they should come back to you with a few options. I gave our TA a long list, and she came back with 4 options in Riviera Maya and 4 in Punta Cana. We selected Azul Sensatori because it was Family Friendly, with adults only, less expensive, and great resort, good food, and overall a good vibe. Plus, she negotiated 2017 room rates for our 2018 wedding - saving our guests $$.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"color:#696969;\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\">Cheers to Love, Laughter, and Happily Ever After<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"aleegriff@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.180.190.28","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1484507663,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-288307.jpg?_r=1484509210","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TandAGetHitched","Id":288307,"Name":"TandAGetHitched","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.250.29.210","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81110,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1502879492,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e92ea0adf7a4b2540d74d2763eab7139","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;See. I kind of feel like my TA didn&#039;t real do anything. She asked what they offered and relayed the message to us. We were quoted 1400 per couple for 4 days 3 nights. Is that about what your guests were quoted as well @[member=\"TandAGetHitched\"]?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1918061,"PostDate":1502879266,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>See. I kind of feel like my TA didn't real do anything. She asked what they offered and relayed the message to us. We were quoted 1400 per couple for 4 days 3 nights. Is that about what your guests were quoted as well @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"288307\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/288307-tandagethitched\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TandAGetHitched<\/span><\/a>?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Francesca\u00a0","Email":"fandreolli@aol.com","IpAddress":"207.250.29.210","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1502114633,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-289213.jpg?_r=1502194320","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"fandreolli","Id":289213,"Name":"fandreolli","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.95.180.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81110,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1502899597,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"32ff6f4f767a8662bad08d2f9208aa54","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congratulations and welcome to the BDW forum!! Please let us know if we can answer any questions for you. We&#039;re here to help and if you&#039;d like a BDW TA to contact you please click the link below. Thanks! TA Patty&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1918063,"PostDate":1502899579,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congratulations and welcome to the BDW forum!! Please let us know if we can answer any questions for you. We're here to help and if you'd like a BDW TA to contact you please click the link below. Thanks! TA Patty<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>? We are an award winning travel agency and you can read our reviews <\/span><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>HERE.<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>Awards and recognition: <\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Palace Resorts Top PRO Agency <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency | <\/span><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner | Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"patty@wrighttravelagency.com","IpAddress":"76.95.92.213","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1278657480,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230028.jpg?_r=1398727965","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TA Patty","Id":230028,"Name":"TA Patty","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.250.140.90","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81110,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4b13e7dc266df5b9ffe70be6eadc7664","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"fandreolli\"] - yep, that&#039;s very similar to the rate our TA got for us. $1400 for 2 adults for 3 nights is cheaper than if they booked direct on the Azul website, which is currently $1886 for 2 people\/3 nights for our wedding dates in May 2018 - &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/bookingengine.karismahotels.com\/&#039;&gt;https:\/\/bookingengine.karismahotels.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I think the group rates and sometimes the perks, can depend on the TA status they have with Karisma... (diamond vs. silver)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.karismatravelagents.com\/SearchReturn_Givc.cfm?country_id=3&amp;amp;state_id=812&amp;amp;wedding_specialist=1&amp;amp;searchGIVC=Search#&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.karismatravelagents.com\/SearchReturn_Givc.cfm?country_id=3&amp;amp;state_id=812&amp;amp;wedding_specialist=1&amp;amp;searchGIVC=Search#&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1918071,"PostDate":1502995231,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"289213\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/289213-fandreolli\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">fandreolli<\/span><\/a> - yep, that's very similar to the rate our TA got for us. $1400 for 2 adults for 3 nights is cheaper than if they booked direct on the Azul website, which is currently $1886 for 2 people\/3 nights for our wedding dates in May 2018 - <a href='https:\/\/bookingengine.karismahotels.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/bookingengin...ismahotels.com\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I think the group rates and sometimes the perks, can depend on the TA status they have with Karisma... (diamond vs. silver)<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.karismatravelagents.com\/SearchReturn_Givc.cfm?country_id=3&state_id=812&wedding_specialist=1&searchGIVC=Search#' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.karismatr...rchGIVC=Search#<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"color:#696969;\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\">Cheers to Love, Laughter, and Happily Ever After<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"aleegriff@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.180.190.28","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1484507663,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-288307.jpg?_r=1484509210","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TandAGetHitched","Id":288307,"Name":"TandAGetHitched","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.250.29.210","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81110,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6872b263dd05c214ca30e79a17986664","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thank you. Are you having real flowers or I saw a lot of people talking about using real touch flowers. I am so afraid taht they will look cheap and fake. Do you know anything about that? What will you be doing? Lomas seems like their bouquets are quite pricey.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1918080,"PostDate":1503067844,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thank you. Are you having real flowers or I saw a lot of people talking about using real touch flowers. I am so afraid taht they will look cheap and fake. Do you know anything about that? What will you be doing? Lomas seems like their bouquets are quite pricey.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Francesca\u00a0","Email":"fandreolli@aol.com","IpAddress":"207.250.29.210","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1502114633,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-289213.jpg?_r=1502194320","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"fandreolli","Id":289213,"Name":"fandreolli","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"172.58.233.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81110,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8412d649b5615b4c74f5a6df07ced212","RawContent":"Thanks all, i was conaidering a ta to make life easier, i will deff look into the karisma hotels. Iwant real flowers, im afraid anything else will look fake. Ill take any suggestions for good ta&#039;s!\n\nSent from my SM-G935T using Tapatalk\n[quote name=\"TA Patty\" post=\"1918063\" timestamp=\"1502899579\"]\nCongratulations and welcome to the BDW forum!! Please let us know if we can answer any questions for you. We&#039;re here to help and if you&#039;d like a BDW TA to contact you please click the link below. Thanks! TA Patty[\/quote]What is a bdw ta? And what link?\n\nSent from my SM-G935T using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1918082,"PostDate":1503068649,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks all, i was conaidering a ta to make life easier, i will deff look into the karisma hotels. Iwant real flowers, im afraid anything else will look fake. Ill take any suggestions for good ta's!<br><br>\nSent from my SM-G935T using Tapatalk<br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>TA Patty, on 16 August 2017 - 08:06 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Congratulations and welcome to the BDW forum!! Please let us know if we can answer any questions for you. We're here to help and if you'd like a BDW TA to contact you please click the link below. Thanks! TA Patty<\/p><\/div><\/div>What is a bdw ta? And what link?<br><br>\nSent from my SM-G935T using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ms.wedding.720@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.58.233.104","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1502383678,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"scamacho","Id":289233,"Name":"scamacho","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.95.180.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81110,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4fb8be0e2b48af3652bf5e18668beb82","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi there - A travel agent from the Best Destination Wedding (BDW) forum. The BDW forum is owned and operated by Wright Travel and we are all certified destination wedding specialists and Wright Travel is a level Diamond 5 agency!! &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Click on the following link and you can request a BDW travel agent contact you -&amp;nbsp;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/\" title=\"External link\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"&gt;Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial;color:rgb(0,128,128);\"&gt;? We are an award winning travel agency and you can read our reviews&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/\" title=\"\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HERE.&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1918083,"PostDate":1503070664,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi there - A travel agent from the Best Destination Wedding (BDW) forum. The BDW forum is owned and operated by Wright Travel and we are all certified destination wedding specialists and Wright Travel is a level Diamond 5 agency!! \u00a0 \u00a0Click on the following link and you can request a BDW travel agent contact you -\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><span  style=\"font-family:arial;color:rgb(0,128,128)\">? We are an award winning travel agency and you can read our reviews\u00a0<\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\"><strong>HERE.<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>? We are an award winning travel agency and you can read our reviews <\/span><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>HERE.<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>Awards and recognition: <\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Palace Resorts Top PRO Agency <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Travel I