 got back from doing site visits in Cancun over New Years and my fiance and I fel...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"gwendolyn.brink@gmail.com","IpAddress":"63.73.199.69","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1450121147,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285590.png?_r=1452183958","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":176,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"GwendolynB","Id":285590,"Name":"GwendolynB","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[],"Id":"79846","Title":"Hyatt Ziva Cancun - Roll Call!","LastPostDate":1502383738}],"Filters":{"Period":[],"Other":[]}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":126,"TotalPages":7,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":120},"PushNotifications":[]}
